    "globalRules": [
      "All screen transitions use PUSH (left) for forward navigation, PUSH (right) for back navigation",
      "Sheet overlays (frame-03) use SLIDE UP from y=812 to final y, SLIDE DOWN to dismiss",
      "Toast notifications slide down from top, auto-dismiss after 1.5s with fade-up",
      "Cards and list items stagger in with 60-80ms delay between each item",
      "Dark gradient backgrounds use subtle orb animation (scale 1→1.15, 4s ease-in-out loop)",
      "Fire emoji (🔥) in StreakBanner does a soft bounce every 3 seconds",
      "Progress/XP bars always animate width from 0 to target value on entry (600-800ms easeOut)",
      "SVG donut chart segments animate stroke-dasharray from 0 to target value, staggered 150ms per segment",
      "Buttons scale to 0.97 on press (active state), spring back on release"
