      "For the XP bar fill, use two variants of the bar component (empty / filled) and Smart Animate",
      "NavBar active indicator (3px top bar) moves between positions using Smart Animate",
      "Use Figma Variables for color tokens to support light/dark theming",
      "For the donut chart, create each segment as a separate arc shape with an 'empty' and 'filled' variant",
